        {
         "@type": "meaningComprehension",
         "comprehends": [
          "copies/md908xy8241.jsonld#inscription-text"
         ],
         "note": "stamped, running down the roll at about sixty degrees; read after rotating. Six figures, 1 8 1 2 2 7. The 8 shows both loops. The fourth figure is over-inked and nearly filled, but keeps the round top, the diagonal and the base stroke of the fifth figure, a plain 2, so 18.12.27. Later than the 1904-1926 span reading.md reports, though nothing in the image argues against it."
        }
       ]
      }
     }
    },
